OL,3,CSearches continue for missing man from
OL,4,CNorthumberland
OL,6,FSearches are continuing for a man
OL,7,Fmissing from Northumberland.
OL,9,FNorthumbria Police has said enquiries
OL,10,Fare being made to find 22-year-old
OL,11,FLiam, who was last seen heading
OL,12,Ftowards Wylam from Wylam Bridge
OL,13,Fshortly after midnight in the early
OL,14,Fhours of Saturday morning (15 August).
OL,16,FLiam is described as a white man, 6ft
OL,17,F3ins tall, of medium build with dark
OL,18,Fhair. He has tattoos down his right
OL,19,Farm.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/2
