OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1786965501
OL,3,CSearches continue for missing man from
OL,4,CNorthumberland
OL,6,FHe was last seen wearing black
OL,7,Fjoggers, black Nike trainers, a black
OL,8,FT-shirt with large text and a diamond
OL,9,Flogo on the back, and a gold chain.
OL,11,FA police spokesperson said: "Extensive
OL,12,Fenquiries are ongoing, and officers
OL,13,Fand family are growing increasingly
OL,14,Fconcerned for his welfare."
OL,16,FMountain rescue teams have been
OL,17,Fsearching the river near Wylam over
OL,18,Fthe weekend.
